---
import Admin from '../../layouts/Admin.astro';
import ChatImport from '../../components/ChatImport';
const err = Astro.url.searchParams.get('err');
---
<Admin title="Import from WhatsApp">
  <h1 style="font-size:30px">Add listings from WhatsApp</h1>
  <section class="panel stack" style="max-width:720px"><h2 style="font-size:20px">Option 1: Bring in a whole chat (best for many listings)</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:0">Export the chat where you post your listings. We find every listing message, attach the photos you sent with it, and save each one as a hidden draft.</p>
    <details><summary class="link" style="cursor:pointer">How do I export a chat?</summary>
      <ol style="margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:20px;display:grid;gap:6px"><li>Open the chat in WhatsApp (or WhatsApp Business).</li><li><b>iPhone:</b> tap the chat name, then <b>Export Chat</b>, then <b>Attach Media</b>. <b>Android:</b> tap ⋮, <b>More</b>, <b>Export chat</b>, <b>Include media</b>.</li><li>Send the .zip to yourself (email or Google Drive), then choose it below. Use a computer if the file is large.</li></ol></details>
    <ChatImport client:load /></section>
  <p class="muted" style="margin:0;max-width:640px">Already posted your plots on WhatsApp? Bring them here instead of typing them again. Everything lands as a hidden draft that you check before it goes live.</p>
  {err && <div class="notice err" role="alert">Paste some text first.</div>}
  <h2 style="font-size:20px;max-width:720px">Option 2: Paste one message</h2>
  <form class="panel stack" method="post" action="/admin/api/import" style="max-width:720px">
    <label class="field">Paste the message here<textarea name="text" rows="10" required maxlength="20000" placeholder={'Green Valley Plots, Habaraduwa Galle\n10 to 25 perches\nRs 5.5 lakhs per perch\nClear deed, electricity, water, tarred road'}></textarea></label>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:0;font-size:14px">Have several? Paste them one after another with a line of <b>---</b> between each. Everything is saved as <b>hidden</b> until you check it.</p>
    <button class="btn lg" style="align-self:flex-start">Create draft listing</button>
  </form>
  <section class="panel stack" style="max-width:720px"><h2 style="font-size:19px">What we read from the message</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:0">The first line becomes the name. We pick out the district, size in perches, price (“5.5 lakhs”, “Rs. 1,250,000”, “12 million”) and whether it says clear deed, electricity, water or tarred road. Photos stay in WhatsApp, so add them on the next page.</p></section>
</Admin>
